-- A match nested past the parser limit, whose arm consumes nothing, ends
-- with errors. The match loop used to parse that arm again forever and ran
-- the compiler out of memory with diagnostics. (Reduced fuzz input; its
-- first error is the malformed spawn, E0101.)
val x=spawn{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{func x{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{{match{{
